// Golden evaluation set for the HS classification pipeline. One JSON object per line.
// Lines that are blank or start with "//" are ignored by scripts/eval-classify.mjs.
//
// Schema:
//   id          short stable identifier
//   description what a user would actually type (the model input)
//   hs6         REQUIRED — correct 6-digit HS 2022 subheading (no dots). Primary scored target.
//   cn8         OPTIONAL — correct 8-digit CN code, only where stable/known (informational; the
//               pure pipeline resolves cn8 via live TARIC, so the offline harness scores hs6).
//   tags        category labels for per-tag breakdowns
//   source      "hand" (manually labelled below) or "bti" (EU Binding Tariff Information ruling)
//   note        the classification basis (GRI / chapter note / why)
//
// NOTE: this seed set is hand-labelled and intentionally small. For statistically
// meaningful accuracy it should be grown to a few hundred rows sourced from the EU
// BTI database (description→code is published and authoritative). Treat current
// numbers as directional, not final.
//
// ── Anchor consumer goods (stress the colloquial→nomenclature lexical gap) ──
